{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nHello"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎レポだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント。いつもありがと、嬉しいぜよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやblog見てても、コメントなかったら、\nその人の感想？\n気持ち？\nわかんないけど blogについて、\nコメントくれると、\nなんかうれしー！\n読んでくれてる！って思うし、その人の気持ちもわかるしっ！\n繋がってるって思って心がホッコリするの..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、前のblogで、\nコメントのこと\nコンメント\nってかいてしまったーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで ？なんで？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントって書いたつもりだったのにー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちくしょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私というものは、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来上がったblogを読み返したはずなのに......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬおーーーーーっっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうこれはあれだね！あれだよ！\n今後気を付けよう←ん？普通のことだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、7月29日は、長崎でイベントがあったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎はなかなか行く機会がないので、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この機会に知っていただけたかたがいると公平に思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃう！光栄に思いますやっ！\nん？\nう〜ん嬉しく思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、いつものかたもいたり、\n久しぶりのかたもいたり、\nもーーーっありが10ぴきありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい笑って〜〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、衣装、黒い靴だったので、\n太陽の熱を吸収して、足めっちゃ暑かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか足の裏の皮が向けた感じで、\nずっとヒリヒリしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは大丈夫でしたか？\n暑さに体調崩さなかったですか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？\n心配です...まあやパワーを送るね!!\n皆さんが元気でありますように...エイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台裏では、次に出演する、ダンスを踊る子たちが沢山いた〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかまあやたちの出演前とか出演後とか、その人たちが手振ってくれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくてニヤニヤしちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って下さい！\nって言ってくれたから、まあやも\n頑張って下さい\nって言っちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうその女の子とは友達だッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヤニヤ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反省点は\n自分たちで皆様を盛り上げなければならないのに、\n皆様が盛り上がってくれて、\n嬉しくて自分が盛り上がってしまうという点です......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだだけど、がんばります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声援が聞こえたよ!!\nいつも支えてくれて本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\nホテルは皆一人部屋でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無理矢理、\n雲ちゃん(美雲さん)を誘いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも優しい雲ちゃんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、温泉があったので、\n岩瀬のゆみこさんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岩瀬のゆみこさん！\n源の頼朝\n小野の妹子\n織田の信長←これは違うか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"織田信長そのままやっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっまぁ、岩瀬のゆみこさん！と畠中のせいらさんと、斎藤のちはるさんと温泉いきました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お湯熱すぎた！\nお湯にはいるの手こずっていたら\n皆サッサと入っていった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岩瀬のゆみこさんなんか\n『お湯温くね？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにゃろー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆すっぴんでもキレイだったよ〜\nウキャ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山人がいたから静かに入ったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だっていい子だも〜ん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、帰りの飛行機は、ねねころの隣でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと英語の勉強を手伝ってくれたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（レッスン前とかにも、若月ちゃんと、深川ちゃんと、いくちゃんにおしえてもらったりするんだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヤニヤ）\n感謝です!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでねっ、ねねころちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛行機が離陸するとき溢れんばかりに瞳に涙を浮かべてました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃわゆいぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/01/5138411/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは飛行機こわい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"}],"source":"archive"}